    // Blue cards, batch 19: digital-only and joke mechanics (conjure, seek's spellbooks, perpetual changes, specialize,
    // boons, drafting, double team, heist, planets/resources, deck-building choices) aren't applied in static or trigger lines
    DIGITAL_ONLY: /\b(?:conjure|conjures|perpetually|spellbook|specializes?|unspecializes?|boons?|draft|double team|heist|resources?|sideboard|sleeve|start your engines|world champion|\[choice|\[a\]|ninjutsu|daunt|poisonous)\b|^planet$|^— as you create your deck/i, // (not applied)
    // White permanents: lines other cards share (not applied; coverage only)
    WP_SHARED: /^(?:as an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature|when this aura enters, enchanted creature gains first strike until end of turn|while an opponent is choosing targets as part of casting a spell they control or activating an ability they control, that player must choose at least one flagbearer on the battlefield if able|if you control a plains, you may tap an untapped creature you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost|as long as enchanted permanent is a vehicle, it's a creature in addition to its other types|creatures you control that are enchanted get \+1\/\+1|this spell costs \{x\} less to cast, where x is your devotion to black|(?:delirium — )?this spell costs \{2\} less to cast if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard|this spell costs \{1\} less to cast for each creature that attacked this turn|ripple \d+)\.?$/i, // (ripple: Surging Might / Surging Sentinels, not applied on permanents; the Surging spells skip it via CAST_ONLY)
    // Colorless artifacts: lines other cards share (not applied; coverage only)
    OA_SHARED: /^(?:all permanents are artifacts in addition to their other types|all cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are colorless|players may spend mana as though it were mana of any color|creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps|players can't draw cards|you don't lose the game for having 0 or less life|players can't untap more than one artifact during their untap steps|remove this card from your deck before playing if you're not playing for ante|starting intensity [01])\.?$/i,
    // Colorless artifacts
    MOX_DIAMOND: /^if this artifact would enter, you may discard a land card instead\. if you do, put this artifact onto the battlefield\. if you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard\.?$/i, // (nearEnters)
    AMULET_VIGOR: /^whenever a permanent you control enters tapped, untap it\.?$/i, // (cardMoved)
    SHUFFLE_SELF_BACK: /^when this artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, its owner shuffles it into their library\.?$/i, // Lembas (cardMoved)
    LOCKS: /^activated abilities of (?:artifacts|creatures) can't be activated\.?$/i, // Null Rod, Cursed Totem (refreshGrants)
    // Colorless artifact creatures
    AC_STATIC: /^(?:shuffle colossus back|as an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card|this creature gets \+1\/\+2|creatures you control have vigilance if it's white, hexproof if it's blue, lifelink if it's black, first strike if it's red, and trample if it's green|each creature you control has vigilance if it's white, hexproof if it's blue, lifelink if it's black, first strike if it's red, and trample if it's green|max speed — this creature gets \+1\/\+2|a deck with this commander can have .+|if at least three mana of the same color was spent to cast this spell, this creature enters with a \+1\/\+1 counter on it)\.?$/i, // (cardMoved for the Colossi; the rest not applied)
    AC_STATIC_MORE: /^(?:this creature can't be blocked by artifact creatures|this creature can't attack alone|if a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard this card|you may have this creature enter as a copy of an artifact or creature you control|this creature enters with x \+1\/\+1 counters on it, where x is the highest number you noted|this creature can't have counters put on it|this creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach|this creature blocks each combat if able).*$/i, // (not applied; coverage only, so other cards with these lines keep what they had)
    AC_TRIGGER: /^(?:whenever you cast a spell of the chosen color|when this creature enters, for each kind of counter on target permanent|whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets \+1\/\+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it|when this creature enters, if mana from a treasure was spent to cast it|whenever another nontoken artifact you control enters, you may pay \{2\}).*$/i, // (not applied; coverage only)
